# BUILD DINEFLOW — COMPLETE RESTAURANT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

You are a senior full-stack software architect, restaurant POS developer, Firebase engineer, database architect and professional SaaS UI/UX designer.

Build a complete, functional, real-time restaurant management web application called DineFlow.

IMPORTANT: Start from scratch. This is a new project, not an existing project repair.

I do not want just a landing page, dashboard design, prototype, wireframe or static UI.

I want an actual working application with connected customer ordering, owner management, waiter operations, kitchen operations, inventory management, billing and reports.

The system must be easy to demonstrate to restaurant owners using one public website URL, QR codes and NFC tags.

The entire application must use one common database, with separate interfaces for different roles.

