19. PROFESSIONAL UI DESIGN
==================================================

Create a premium professional SaaS design.

Follow these seven strict design requirements:

1. No decorative gradients or glows. Use neutral backgrounds (#f4f5f8 or white) and one dark accent colour only.
2. Use Lucide line icons consistently with 1.75px stroke and 16–20px sizing. No emojis as UI icons.
3. Remove non-actionable badges such as NEW, HOT, AI, PRO and Beta. Keep useful status indicators.
4. No cards inside cards. One surface per section, separate items using spacing or 1px dividers.
5. Group related things: label and value 2–4px apart, items in a group 8–12px apart, sections 24px or more apart.
6. Nested corners: inner radius = outer radius − padding.
7. No looping animations. Animate only user interactions and state changes, 150–250ms ease-out.

Use:
- Clean typography.
- Dark navy accent.
- White surfaces.
- Light neutral background.
- Clear tables.
- Professional data visualizations.
- Simple navigation.
- Accessible colours.
- Mobile-first customer interface.

Do not overload the sidebar.

Each portal should have only its relevant navigation.

